    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_946_2801.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich willig dienest, sampt was wir
<lb n="2"/>liebs, unnd guots vermoegen, zuvor. Frommen, Ersamen,
<lb n="3"/>Wysen, besonders getrüw fründt, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidt</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnossen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> begeren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früchten</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halb</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> burger, <persName resp="#ner">Ambrosius Schranckenmüller</persName>, und
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner">Jacob Waecker</persName>, üch zuegefuert, haben wir unßer nachfrag
<lb n="7"/>gehupt, und befunden, das ermelte üwere burger,
<lb n="8"/>das korn zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Alltkilch</placeName>, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoch</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thür</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegenn</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überkon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namblich</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hundert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füuff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sibenzig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viernzel</unclear>, und der-
<lb n="11"/>selben ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yede</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vier</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfund</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Muntz</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eim</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßerem</unclear> burger, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allhieigen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gestifft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schaffnern</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Georg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eckenstein</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkaufft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Souil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> aber das Meß alhie by unns belanget,
<lb n="15"/>da werdtend wir bericht, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aecht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fiertel</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Meß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear>, alls by uns ein viernzel, so da sechzechen
<lb n="17"/>Meeß gelltet, thuen sollen.
<lb n="18"/>Welches wir üch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgemellt</unclear> üwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begertem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niet</unclear> verhallten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfarrung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerwysen</unclear>, sind wir
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yederzyt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgeneigt</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1571" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Mittwuoch
<lb n="22"/>den xxiij Maij. Ao etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lxxj</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="23"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hanscuonradt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Meyer</unclear></persName>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-530" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">burger-
<lb n="24"/>meister, und der Rath der Statt
<lb n="25"/>Basell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_946_2802.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_946_2803.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_946_2804.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="26"/>Den frommen, ersamen, wysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger=
<lb n="27"/>meister, und Rath der statt zuo Sanct Gal=
<lb n="28"/>len</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jnsonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guttenn</unclear> frunden,
<lb n="29"/>unnd getreuwenn liebenn eidtgnossenn.
</p>
